WEBVTT

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.500
Killing... Art...

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:54.280
A-Am I dead...?

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.660
That girl is...

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.620
Over here!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.830
Huh?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:14.630
Seisa...?

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:19.630
Just now, there was this
<i>huge</i> boar that appeared in front of me!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:25.180
So I crumpled it up like this and threw it away!

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:34.610
Ichinomiya...! I missed you!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.030
Shigure?!

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:52.380
Eruna!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.670
Shigure!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:57.090
Palette Barrett!

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:02.890
Hero Time!

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:07.520
Eruna...!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:19.400
Ryui...!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:27.120
I wanted... someone to catch me, too... ryui...

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:32.210
Mr. Bimii, I'm going to see how Seisa's doing.

00:04:32.420 --> 00:04:33.580
I'm leaving the rest to you.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.880
Are you hurt, Eruna?

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.550
Th-Thanks...

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.970
It was my first time seeing
your Hero Time, Shigure...

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:49.980
The manga hero that I admired saved
the heroine in the nick of time like this.

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:52.770
And then the two fell in love...

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:55.190
And shared a passionate kis—

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.240
Eruna!

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.120
Eruna!

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:06.700
Eruna!

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:09.040
Otone! Asuhi and the others, too!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:13.120
Ow...

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.000
Huh?

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.380
I'm so glad you're okay...

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.420
Eruna!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:23.300
- I was so worried...
- Otone...

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:29.760
What happened? The school
buildings have been destroyed...

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:34.810
This is no simple matter.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:41.440
This is what I saw! Now you all
believe me, right? Right? Right?!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.110
Sorry for doubting you!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:46.200
We'd believe you even if you
didn't sound so desperate, rowr!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:50.450
The mystery has been solved,
so let's go to the next match, Akama.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.660
Let's see... What clubs
were in the next match again?

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:59.670
Hmm... Should we bet
on the so-so impact of this?

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:04.260
Wouldn't it be better to put that incident
with the ghost on the front page?

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:05.550
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:08.300
What an amazing production!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:10.010
As expected of the midterm battles!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:12.220
Oh yeah, let's take a picture!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.430
Say cheese!

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:17.690
Everyone's unexpectedly calm about this...

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:19.770
They're so carefree!

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:28.030
My lady, this is from the
endearing paint-covered Yankee.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.700
I don't want it.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:43.000
I wonder what happened.
When I was falling, I had a dream.

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:47.840
There was a girl that looked like Seisa,
and the girl I met in the hidden room,

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:50.470
and even a boy that looked like you came out

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:55.680
and said, "Ichinomiya!" in a gross way
that sounded just like you, too.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.350
In the first place, Mikagura Academy
was built a long time ago

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:05.860
by the Mikagura, Ichinomiya, and
Ninomiya family ancestors working together.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:08.740
Huh? Our ancestors were involved, too?

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:13.370
Yeah. The mysterious power that everyone has—

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:19.250
Mikagura Academy was built in order
for people to learn to use it properly.

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:21.880
The most important thing
was the feeling of having fun.

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:25.210
That feeling is what made the abilities manifest.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.590
In order to teach that, the Mikagura ancestor

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:32.890
used her power to create something
out of nothing on these vast grounds

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:35.720
and created Mikagura Academy overnight.

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:41.520
And then the Ichinomiya ancestor
put up a barrier around the school.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:43.520
What did Ninomiya do?

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.190
Um... Cheer them on?

00:07:47.780 --> 00:07:51.740
The girl in the hidden room
who granted you power

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.280
was probably the Ichinomiya ancestor.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.830
But why did she give me that power?

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.830
She probably wanted you to save Seisa.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:00.620
Huh?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.500
According to rumors, around the
time Mikagura Academy was built,

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:08.550
the young Mikagura girl closed her
heart because of a slight misunderstanding

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.010
and the young Ichinomiya girl saved her.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:19.020
The school has turned into this right now
because Seisa's power is slowly weakening.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:27.780
Mr. Bimii tried a bunch of
different things to drag Seisa out, too.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:30.860
Could that be why you
asked me to come to Mikagura?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:33.280
You should've told me that from the start—

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:36.740
If you became Seisa's friend
out of pity from the start,

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.870
that wouldn't have made Seisa happy, either.

00:08:40.080 --> 00:08:42.790
That's not real friendship.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.960
I'm sure that's why Mr. Bimii didn't say anything.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:47.130
Ryui...

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.470
Then there's just one thing for me to do!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:52.930
I want to see Seisa's smile!

00:08:55.470 --> 00:08:57.640
Ding-dong!

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:00.270
Seisa, please come out!

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:04.150
I need to talk to you, Seisa!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.480
Hm?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.020
Minatogawa!

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:11.030
Calcium is the best for
calming down, as I thought.

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:12.700
Wait, milk?!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:15.410
Kuzuryu gave it to me.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:22.040
Right now, this mansion doesn't need calcium.
It needs pretty flowers, I think.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.170
Wow, amazing!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.710
Thank you very much, Minatogawa!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:39.430
Seisa, I need to talk to you.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.480
I have nothing to say to you. Go home.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:47.110
Seisa, won't you quit the
going-home club and join our club?

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:49.480
The I'll Figure It out Later Club!

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:51.230
What a foolish name.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.950
I'll decide the official name after you join, Seisa.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:58.370
I want to make it a club
where you can have fun, Seisa!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:02.370
I am having enough fun
in the going-home club right now.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.120
I won't have anything to do
with anyone else anymore.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.630
That's what I decided that day...

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:13.590
Then, if our club wins
the midterm battles, please join!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.050
Do you think we can't win?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.220
I won't know unless I try!

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:25.350
But that's fine. If you think it's
impossible, then please promise—

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:28.350
That you'll join if I win!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.730
Once you join, I'm sure we'll have fun!

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.570
We'll have so much fun we'll laugh.

00:10:32.780 --> 00:10:36.280
And it'll be such a fun club that
we'll laugh until we can't breathe!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.410
Seisa, I...

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:47.580
I will never, <i>ever</i> betray you!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.290
So let's have fun together!

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:11.110
Your next match is against your fateful first
opponent, Himi from the calligraphy club!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.980
If you don't hurry, you'll be late for the match.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.280
Wait, where are you going?

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:18.660
I remembered something
I have to do, so go on ahead!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:20.030
What's wrong, ryui?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:21.740
What do you have to do?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.740
I need to greet someone!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.250
It's gone...

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:36.460
That hidden room... I think it was around here...

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.890
Great ancestor from that time, are you here?

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:51.060
Thank you for granting me power!

00:11:54.190 --> 00:11:58.650
Even if I can't see you, if you're
around somewhere, please listen!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.320
I will definitely make Seisa smile!

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.660
Just like you did back then!

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:13.710
So please don't worry. Just watch...!

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:22.140
Midterm battles, B-block, third round.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.100
Calligraphy club versus the
I'll Figure It out Later Club.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:27.770
Let's go, Himi!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:31.350
Hah, you can't beat me!

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.900
Begin the match.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:47.030
It's not over yet! Let's go, Eruna!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.580
Of course, Himi!

00:13:02.220 --> 00:13:03.760
My lady.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:08.470
My lady, why don't you try
acting a little like an eejit, too?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.390
Well, don't go too overboard, though.

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.820
I lost...!

00:13:19.030 --> 00:13:21.940
This is no time to pretend to cry, Himi.

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:28.620
In the semifinals, Kuzuryu defeated
Minatogawa and is advancing to the finals!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.250
Now, it is finally time for the finals!

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:37.920
The competitors are:

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.250
The art club versus

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:42.630
the dark horse, the I'll Figure It Out Later Club!

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.640
This is impossible, isn't it?

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:53.810
Even if Ichinomiya beat Himi,
there's no way she can beat Kuzuryu...

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:58.020
I don't know.
Today's Eruna might have a chance...

00:14:00.070 --> 00:14:05.320
Now, let's interview my sweet honey,
Eruna, before the match...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.120
Wha...! Who are you people?!

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:14.290
B-Bastard, you're the uncle
who knows Miracle Man's secret!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.790
You should've been defeated by Miracle Friday...

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:22.300
Bwahahaha! There wasn't just <i>one</i> uncle!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.380
Wha...?!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.130
Um...

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.140
Miracle Man, save me! Sir.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:32.680
M-Miracle Man, save me, sir!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:37.480
Damn it, let go!

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:43.940
Miracle Man, your biggest
mistake was overlooking the aunt!

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:48.160
Now, Charisma Colonizer,
See-Through the 38th!

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:51.120
Capture Kyoma Kuzuryu!

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:52.830
Will you please come with us?

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.700
Come quietly, rowr!

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.830
Stop it! Let go!

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:02.960
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.340
Oh no, Eruna's opponent
for the final has been abducted!

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.680
What in the world are we to do...?

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:13.560
At this rate, we won't be able
to have the all-important final match...!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:16.890
Oh, that's...!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.030
What an unexpected development!

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:29.860
After all this time,
a super seed has been announced?!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:33.370
And, that super seed is...

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:39.750
Representative of the
Going-Home Club, Seisa Mikagura!

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.170
Seisa...

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:49.880
If you win, you said
you'd let me join your club, right?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.890
Yes!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.470
I wonder if you can do it.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.980
Yes! I'm not going to hold back,
so prepare yourself!

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.730
That's what I wanted.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:06.940
Begin the match.

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:20.920
Why won't you use your power?

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:27.130
'Cause you can't use your Killing Art.
I just want to fight you fair and square!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.890
It looks like your power's returned.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.940
Apparently, it has.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:36.200
Then, we can finally start the real fight!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.910
Killing Art!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.000
What in the world is happening?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:50.670
They're fighting in the sky, ryui!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.590
They're completely ignoring
the laws of physics, ryui!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.300
It's crazy, ryui!

00:17:55.050 --> 00:17:56.050
But the two of them...

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.050
...look like they're having a lot of fun!

00:17:58.260 --> 00:18:00.850
Let's decide this quickly.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:02.520
Killing Art!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.740
Tension <i>super</i> max!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:45.890
Go...!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.710
End of the match.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:24.810
That was fun, Seisa.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:28.690
But unfortunately, I couldn't win.

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.650
But you didn't lose. So...

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:33.940
Huh?

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.940
I wouldn't mind joining your club.

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:37.150
Huh?

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.530
Thank you so much, Seisa!

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:48.710
But first, shouldn't you think
of a proper name for the club?

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:52.080
Don't worry about that! I just thought of one!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.960
What is it?

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:56.090
Afterschool Paradise Club!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.050
What is that club supposed to do?

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:05.260
We can do anything!
